# Finish without lint warnings

A change is done only when `pnpm lint` and the TypeScript build report nothing, including warnings.

Oxlint does not see Tailwind `suggestCanonicalClasses` warnings. Before finishing a UI or class-name change, rewrite any class Tailwind can express with a built-in utility.

```tsx
// left-[calc(var(--sidebar-width)*-1)]
className="-left-(--sidebar-width)"

// [backface-visibility:hidden]
className="backface-hidden"
```

Check every class string in the files you touched, not only the line that was reported.
